Licensing of this entry
=======================

The upstream fourcolor material and adaptations of it retain the CeCILL-B
licence and notices. The full upstream licence is reproduced, without editing,
in LICENSES/CeCILL-B.txt. See NOTICE for the upstream revision and attribution.

Original additions by the ai-proofs project are covered by the repository's
MIT licence, reproduced in LICENSES/MIT.txt. The MIT licence does not replace
or remove the upstream licence or its attribution conditions.

This entry is not declared to be uniformly covered by the AFP's default BSD
licence. Its licence classification must be agreed with the AFP editors before
submission. No upstream material has been silently relicensed.
